#5800
The Pyramid of the Serpent~
This area (5801-5890) forms the 2nd-5th levels of the Pyramid of the Serpent.
The 1st level is contained in zone 57. The pyramid is a deadly area containing
wondorous treasures and even more wondorous snakes and traps. I expect high
level characters in a well-balanced group will still find this area quite
challenging.

This area was written by Vex.
~
